1
00:00:11,380 --> 00:00:17,520
Aiming for the sunset
floating over the Nakagawa,

2
00:00:18,060 --> 00:00:24,660
I kick a pebble and my shoes fly off too,

3
00:00:25,740 --> 00:00:32,940
onto the head of the carpenter
I was putting in a choke hold.

4
00:00:32,940 --> 00:00:39,140
They laughed that I'm still just a brat.

5
00:00:39,770 --> 00:00:44,220
Even if I somehow stir up some energy,

6
00:00:44,220 --> 00:00:49,280
pachinko, a sigh, a yawn,
and still nothing changes.

7
00:00:49,280 --> 00:00:53,180
The streets feel strangely gentle.

8
00:00:54,660 --> 00:01:01,240
From the pointed hat's water basin,

9
00:01:01,240 --> 00:01:07,440
the sunset sinks into the vast sky.

10
00:01:11,020 --> 00:01:15,920
Tomorrow will end this way too, won't it.

11
00:01:15,920 --> 00:01:21,100
Katsushika, Shibamata,
I lost happiness again.

12
00:01:21,100 --> 00:01:24,600
Because I'm a fool who
only just realized it.

13
00:01:29,500 --> 00:01:31,840
Hair is a long friend today.

14
00:01:36,340 --> 00:01:39,660
Good morning, senior officer.

15
00:01:42,440 --> 00:01:44,620
Ryo-chan,
your hair's gotten long, hasn't it?

16
00:01:45,740 --> 00:01:48,100
Now that you mention it,
I haven't gotten it cut in a while.

17
00:01:48,100 --> 00:01:51,500
Why don't I just keep growing
it and make it like Kimutaku's?

18
00:01:52,220 --> 00:01:53,700
Long hair, dangle-dangle.

19
00:01:54,140 --> 00:01:56,100
Women won't leave me alone with this.

20
00:01:58,120 --> 00:01:58,840
That's a bit much.

21
00:01:58,840 --> 00:02:00,200
Absolutely not.

22
00:02:00,200 --> 00:02:01,560
Please cut it.

23
00:02:02,260 --> 00:02:03,560
Fine, I get it.

24
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:07,760
What are you doing?
Using my scissors without asking!

25
00:02:07,760 --> 00:02:09,900
You're the one who wrecked them!

26
00:02:09,900 --> 00:02:11,620
Why don't you just go to the barber?

27
00:02:11,620 --> 00:02:12,920
I'm broke, damn it.

28
00:02:12,920 --> 00:02:14,220
Fine, there's no helping it.

29
00:02:14,220 --> 00:02:18,100
I think there's a salon kit in the back,
so I'll cut it for you.

30
00:02:18,100 --> 00:02:21,160
Don't expect too much.
I'm not a professional, you know.

31
00:02:21,740 --> 00:02:23,120
As long as it gets shorter, that's enough.

32
00:02:23,120 --> 00:02:27,640
But now that I look at it closely,
Ryo-chan, your hair is really thick, isn't it?

33
00:02:27,640 --> 00:02:29,800
That looks like five times a normal person's amount,
doesn't it?

34
00:02:29,800 --> 00:02:32,640
My head can even be used
as a scrubbing brush!

35
00:02:32,640 --> 00:02:35,800
Reiko, should I scrub your body too?

36
00:02:35,800 --> 00:02:38,660
Stop saying silly things. Let's get started.

37
00:02:39,420 --> 00:02:40,960
It's caught in there.

38
00:02:41,340 --> 00:02:42,220
It won't come out.

39
00:02:42,220 --> 00:02:43,540
What did you just say?

40
00:02:47,480 --> 00:02:48,360
It's in the way! Stop it!

41
00:02:49,020 --> 00:02:51,180
We'll have no choice
but to cut it at the root.

42
00:02:52,200 --> 00:02:54,520
It's caught again.

43
00:02:54,680 --> 00:02:55,560
W-why?!

44
00:03:01,280 --> 00:03:03,360
I'll try clipping it
short with the clippers.

45
00:03:04,920 --> 00:03:06,500
It's caught again.

46
00:03:06,620 --> 00:03:07,780
Why?!

47
00:03:09,680 --> 00:03:10,720
That hurts!

48
00:03:11,240 --> 00:03:12,560
Come on, this one.

49
00:03:17,620 --> 00:03:18,920
Aaaaaaah!

50
00:03:18,920 --> 00:03:19,940
Aaaaaaah!

51
00:03:23,480 --> 00:03:32,740
Reiko, sorry for the wait, I really tried,
but it just won't fit together...

52
00:03:32,740 --> 00:03:34,280
Aaaaaaah!

53
00:03:34,280 --> 00:03:34,560
Aaaaaaah!

54
00:03:34,560 --> 00:03:36,780
Aaaaaaah!

55
00:03:37,780 --> 00:03:40,740
I'll lend you the money,
so go on, off to the chocolate shop!

56
00:03:45,280 --> 00:03:46,040
Welcome!

57
00:03:49,400 --> 00:03:53,220
I'm sorry, I'll give you all the money,
just please spare my life!

58
00:03:53,220 --> 00:03:55,918
Hey, what are you getting
the wrong idea about?

59
00:03:55,968 --> 00:03:57,660
I'm just a customer.

60
00:03:58,860 --> 00:04:01,060
I'm sorry, you're a customer?

61
00:04:01,200 --> 00:04:01,980
That's right.

62
00:04:01,980 --> 00:04:04,730
I'm sorry, but the manager is out right now,

63
00:04:04,780 --> 00:04:06,180
he won't be back until the afternoon.

64
00:04:07,780 --> 00:04:09,820
I'm sorry, I'm still just an apprentice.

65
00:04:09,820 --> 00:04:12,260
Alright then, I'll be your practice dummy.

66
00:04:12,260 --> 00:04:13,620
Really?

67
00:04:13,620 --> 00:04:16,300
But since it's practice,
it's free, you know.

68
00:04:16,300 --> 00:04:18,700
Yes, I'll do my very best.

69
00:04:18,700 --> 00:04:20,880
Yes! I just saved on the haircut money!

70
00:04:20,880 --> 00:04:23,860
Yes, it's been three years since
I moved to Tokyo to become a barber.

71
00:04:23,860 --> 00:04:26,020
Finally, I get to cut a real human's head.

72
00:04:26,720 --> 00:04:27,940
Well then, this way, please.

73
00:04:40,760 --> 00:04:43,840
Even so, I'd like to learn from you.
You're really skilled with those scissors.

74
00:04:43,840 --> 00:04:44,720
Sorry.

75
00:04:44,720 --> 00:04:47,740
I wasn't scolding you. I was praising you.

76
00:04:47,740 --> 00:04:48,780
Sorry, I just...

77
00:04:48,780 --> 00:04:52,040
You've been saying
"sorry" nonstop since earlier. It's annoying. Knock it off already.

78
00:04:52,040 --> 00:04:53,140
Sorry.

79
00:04:54,380 --> 00:04:57,060
Well, anyway, what's your name?

80
00:04:57,060 --> 00:04:58,080
Sorry.

81
00:04:58,080 --> 00:05:01,560
I told you to stop!
I'm only asking for your name.

82
00:05:01,560 --> 00:05:02,220
Sorry.

83
00:05:02,220 --> 00:05:05,100
That's why I said don't apologize.
It's a name, a name!

84
00:05:05,100 --> 00:05:05,860
Sorry.

85
00:05:08,520 --> 00:05:09,860
Sorry, sorry.

86
00:05:09,860 --> 00:05:12,880
But my name is Sorry Tarō.

87
00:05:12,880 --> 00:05:14,460
Name?

88
00:05:15,240 --> 00:05:17,040
What a confusing name you've got.

89
00:05:17,040 --> 00:05:18,200
Sorry.

90
00:05:18,200 --> 00:05:20,360
Sorry Tarō, I'm going to sleep.

91
00:05:20,360 --> 00:05:21,620
Wake me when you're done.

92
00:05:21,620 --> 00:05:22,020
Yes.

93
00:05:25,100 --> 00:05:25,820
Fast.

94
00:05:35,440 --> 00:05:36,840
Okay, cut finished.

95
00:05:43,100 --> 00:05:44,460
The real problem starts here.

96
00:05:45,340 --> 00:05:47,840
Shaving is what I'm worst at.

97
00:05:49,880 --> 00:05:52,040
Let's practice a little first.

98
00:05:56,720 --> 00:05:57,600
Why?

99
00:05:57,920 --> 00:05:59,660
Sorry, it's nothing.

100
00:05:59,660 --> 00:06:00,820
I see.

101
00:06:03,680 --> 00:06:04,860
I'm uneasy.

102
00:06:05,300 --> 00:06:08,140
But I have to do it to
become a proper customer.

103
00:06:14,020 --> 00:06:15,260
It's not cutting.

104
00:06:15,620 --> 00:06:18,880
I see, this guy's got more
nerve than most people.

105
00:06:19,300 --> 00:06:20,960
With this, I'll even things out properly.

106
00:06:34,860 --> 00:06:35,480
Whoa!

107
00:06:36,640 --> 00:06:37,520
My eyebrow!

108
00:06:38,420 --> 00:06:40,960
What's going on? Are you finished?

109
00:06:41,320 --> 00:06:43,780
I'm sorry! Not yet! Not yet!

110
00:06:44,060 --> 00:06:44,880
Ugh, I see.

111
00:06:48,160 --> 00:06:50,180
I'll just have to somehow cover it up.

112
00:06:54,780 --> 00:06:56,320
Was it this kind of eyebrow?

113
00:06:57,340 --> 00:06:58,580
No, that's wrong.

114
00:06:59,660 --> 00:07:00,800
This one's wrong too.

115
00:07:00,800 --> 00:07:02,180
Totally wrong.

116
00:07:02,180 --> 00:07:03,700
Not like this.

117
00:07:34,720 --> 00:07:35,280
Nice and neat.

118
00:07:41,140 --> 00:07:42,020
Pramoa

119
00:07:42,020 --> 00:07:43,460
Is that you, Ryo-san?

120
00:07:43,680 --> 00:07:45,180
I went to get a haircut.

121
00:07:45,180 --> 00:07:46,400
Don't I look handsome now?

122
00:07:46,960 --> 00:07:47,320
Yeah.

123
00:07:47,320 --> 00:07:51,220
Is that the latest trend or something?

124
00:07:52,560 --> 00:07:53,680
I went and got it done.

125
00:07:54,080 --> 00:07:55,940
Oh my, you look a lot neater.

126
00:07:55,940 --> 00:07:57,720
You look cool, senpai.

127
00:07:58,400 --> 00:07:59,020
I see.

128
00:07:59,520 --> 00:08:01,820
Especially these eyebrows,
they're so evenly trimmed.

129
00:08:02,260 --> 00:08:03,200
Uh-oh, it fell off!

130
00:08:40,680 --> 00:08:44,380
So I made fake eyebrows out of that guy's eyebrow hair.
What do you think?

131
00:08:44,380 --> 00:08:45,460
Creepy.

132
00:08:45,460 --> 00:08:47,120
You look like a different person, senpai.

133
00:08:47,120 --> 00:08:48,440
It doesn't suit you that much.

134
00:08:48,440 --> 00:08:50,840
If I just do it like this, maybe...

135
00:08:55,980 --> 00:08:58,260
You're finally back to normal.

136
00:08:58,260 --> 00:09:00,600
You should do something about your hair too.

137
00:09:00,600 --> 00:09:01,660
Yeah, I guess.

138
00:09:02,500 --> 00:09:04,940
I'll pass on this one, since Tarō's here.

139
00:09:06,820 --> 00:09:09,420
A high-tech shop Sounds interesting.

140
00:09:14,360 --> 00:09:16,340
I see, it really is pretty high-tech.

141
00:09:19,220 --> 00:09:20,480
Welcome!

142
00:09:28,440 --> 00:09:29,580
How is it?

143
00:09:29,580 --> 00:09:34,300
This computer-controlled chair and automatic
towel-wrapping machine I developed myself.

144
00:09:34,300 --> 00:09:36,120
Not bad, is it?

145
00:09:37,160 --> 00:09:37,520
Thank you.

146
00:09:38,340 --> 00:09:40,240
Sir, how would you like it today?

147
00:09:40,560 --> 00:09:42,180
Give me a crew cut, nice and clean.

148
00:09:42,180 --> 00:09:43,120
Certainly.

149
00:09:43,780 --> 00:09:46,480
I'm going to take a nap,
so wake me when you're done.

150
00:09:48,500 --> 00:09:49,220
Fast.

151
00:09:49,220 --> 00:09:51,800
Hey, one-touch clippers on standby.

152
00:09:51,800 --> 00:09:52,760
Okay!

153
00:09:57,480 --> 00:09:58,540
Stop it, quick!

154
00:10:07,300 --> 00:10:10,020
Tarō, learn how to operate it already!

155
00:10:10,020 --> 00:10:11,060
Sorry.

156
00:10:11,540 --> 00:10:13,660
He insisted on becoming a customer, so

157
00:10:13,660 --> 00:10:16,000
I hired him even though he
was fired from somewhere else.

158
00:10:16,000 --> 00:10:16,880
Sorry.

159
00:10:17,340 --> 00:10:20,200
Then set the one-touch
clippers on the customer's head.

160
00:10:20,200 --> 00:10:21,080
Sorry.

161
00:10:22,800 --> 00:10:25,380
Whatever you do,
don't let them start running on their own.

162
00:10:25,380 --> 00:10:25,740
Yes.

163
00:10:28,560 --> 00:10:29,760
There, it worked out.

164
00:10:30,240 --> 00:10:32,160
Next, when you press the blue button,

165
00:10:32,580 --> 00:10:33,298
Okay, there.

166
00:10:33,348 --> 00:10:37,500
the cutter part is set
to wrap around the head.

167
00:10:37,560 --> 00:10:41,148
Good, OK.
Next, when you press the Mitorin button,

168
00:10:41,198 --> 00:10:43,680
Okay, there. Then the cutting starts.

169
00:10:44,920 --> 00:10:48,820
Dadadadada, the stop button, stop, stop!

170
00:10:49,300 --> 00:10:50,500
Did it cut?

171
00:10:52,700 --> 00:10:53,280
Ugh.

172
00:10:54,720 --> 00:10:56,740
I told you not to turn it on.

173
00:10:56,960 --> 00:10:58,240
Ugh, sorry, sorry.

174
00:10:59,280 --> 00:11:01,500
I hope it's been trimmed a little...

175
00:11:10,220 --> 00:11:11,400
He's a regular here.

176
00:11:12,940 --> 00:11:14,120
You know him?

177
00:11:14,120 --> 00:11:15,940
Then leave the rest to you.

178
00:11:18,680 --> 00:11:20,700
Anyway, I'd better apologize.

179
00:11:22,640 --> 00:11:24,040
Are you really okay with it being free?

180
00:11:24,780 --> 00:11:27,080
Sorry, today's our free service day.

181
00:11:28,240 --> 00:11:31,420
Lucky! Today's my lucky day!
Thanks a lot, sorry.

182
00:11:33,120 --> 00:11:34,740
That feels refreshing.

183
00:11:35,400 --> 00:11:35,840
Me

184
00:11:41,820 --> 00:11:46,360
Oh, Ryo-san! What happened?
You got a haircut?

185
00:11:47,000 --> 00:11:54,020
Don't I look handsome now?
Is that kind of look the trend these days

186
00:11:55,060 --> 00:11:55,940
I'm back.

187
00:11:55,940 --> 00:11:57,740
You look nice and tidy now.

188
00:11:57,740 --> 00:11:59,380
You look cool, senpai.

189
00:12:00,380 --> 00:12:01,060
Is that so?

190
00:12:03,320 --> 00:12:05,100
What's happened to you too?

191
00:12:07,120 --> 00:12:11,500
I see. He must be repenting for everything
he's done and atoning for his sins.

192
00:12:11,500 --> 00:12:15,440
I see. Now that you mention it,
he's only ever done bad things until now.

193
00:12:16,260 --> 00:12:18,620
Senpai, you finally understand.

194
00:12:18,620 --> 00:12:19,560
Understand what?

195
00:12:19,560 --> 00:12:22,600
Come on. It's clearly written
on the back of your head.

196
00:12:24,580 --> 00:12:25,260
What is this!

197
00:12:26,720 --> 00:12:29,940
So you just got your hair
clipped short by mistake.

198
00:12:29,940 --> 00:12:32,040
No wonder it looked strange.

199
00:12:32,040 --> 00:12:34,020
Ya, nyaaru!

200
00:12:37,000 --> 00:12:38,040
I knew it!

201
00:12:38,860 --> 00:12:40,720
You're supposed to say
"I'm sorry," you idiot!

202
00:12:41,120 --> 00:12:43,020
So this was your doing again!

203
00:12:44,540 --> 00:12:45,760
Ya, nyaaru!

204
00:12:46,000 --> 00:12:47,560
Sorry, sorry.

205
00:12:47,560 --> 00:12:49,980
"Sorry, sorry" is all you say!
We don't need police like you!

206
00:13:00,060 --> 00:13:03,600
I tried making a wig out of his hair.
What do you think?

207
00:13:03,600 --> 00:13:04,660
Creepy.

208
00:13:04,660 --> 00:13:06,520
You look like a completely
different person, senpai.

209
00:13:06,520 --> 00:13:07,840
Does it really look that bad?

210
00:13:26,700 --> 00:13:27,920
So it finally grew out

211
00:13:28,580 --> 00:13:31,480
If you went to a barber and still look like that,
it's just unsightly.

212
00:13:31,880 --> 00:13:32,540
Yeah, I guess so.

213
00:13:33,860 --> 00:13:35,500
Here they shaved off my eyebrow.

214
00:13:36,600 --> 00:13:38,300
And here they gave me a buzz cut.

215
00:13:39,040 --> 00:13:41,120
Let's find a decent place today.

216
00:13:48,540 --> 00:13:51,200
My hair grows so fast that
shaving it is a real hassle.

217
00:13:51,640 --> 00:13:53,700
I wish hair wouldn't grow at all.

218
00:13:54,540 --> 00:13:59,200
In that case, I'd recommend the new
permanent hair removal drug I developed.

219
00:13:59,200 --> 00:14:02,460
It removes the roots themselves,
so hair will never grow back.

220
00:14:02,460 --> 00:14:04,740
That's great! Please, I'll take that one.

221
00:14:05,320 --> 00:14:06,320
Certainly.

222
00:14:10,180 --> 00:14:12,120
Bio Sounds interesting.

223
00:14:14,020 --> 00:14:16,737
Welcome,

224
00:14:16,787 --> 00:14:18,940
right this way.

225
00:14:18,940 --> 00:14:21,360
This place has quite the bio vibe,
doesn't it?

226
00:14:23,340 --> 00:14:27,320
At our shop,
we skillfully apply various bio research.

227
00:14:27,320 --> 00:14:28,860
Dyeing and hair removal,

228
00:14:28,860 --> 00:14:32,720
and some of our products even
permanently fix your hairstyle.

229
00:14:32,720 --> 00:14:34,400
You can do that too?

230
00:14:34,400 --> 00:14:36,620
Bio power is pretty strong, you know.

231
00:14:36,620 --> 00:14:39,120
Then fix my hair in a crew cut, will you?

232
00:14:39,120 --> 00:14:42,360
Then I'll proceed with
the permanent hair fixing.

233
00:14:42,980 --> 00:14:44,300
Sorry, Master.

234
00:14:44,300 --> 00:14:46,440
There's a call for you from the
neighborhood association chairman.

235
00:14:48,460 --> 00:14:49,900
Please hold on a moment.

236
00:14:54,120 --> 00:14:55,940
It's the neighborhood
association meeting, though.

237
00:14:57,780 --> 00:15:02,120
Just today. Ugh, fine, I'm on my way.

238
00:15:02,700 --> 00:15:09,580
Sentarou, take care of the permanent hair removal. Just soak this into the hair.
Even someone as clumsy as you shouldn't be able to mess that up.

239
00:15:10,400 --> 00:15:13,440
Here you go.
I'll be right back, so see you later.

240
00:15:18,460 --> 00:15:19,460
I wonder which one it is.

241
00:15:22,000 --> 00:15:23,840
Sorry, I'll do it right now.

242
00:15:23,840 --> 00:15:28,340
Sorry, understood.

243
00:15:34,280 --> 00:15:37,320
Ugh, even the neighborhood
association get-togethers are a hassle.

244
00:16:12,020 --> 00:16:12,660
What!?

245
00:16:14,320 --> 00:16:15,780
He's that violent a guy?

246
00:16:15,960 --> 00:16:18,760
Sorry, I should have noticed sooner.

247
00:16:20,800 --> 00:16:23,140
Saying the medicine hasn't taken effect yet,

248
00:16:23,140 --> 00:16:25,080
I hope it doesn't work.

249
00:16:25,540 --> 00:16:26,980
It's cold, so cold.

250
00:16:37,020 --> 00:16:37,480
Whoa...

251
00:16:39,460 --> 00:16:40,540
Is it over already?

252
00:16:41,560 --> 00:16:42,940
There's still some stubble left.

253
00:16:42,940 --> 00:16:43,720
I see.

254
00:16:47,700 --> 00:16:48,780
I'll leave the rest to you.

255
00:16:48,780 --> 00:16:50,680
I don't want to die yet, you know.

256
00:16:50,680 --> 00:16:52,140
Sorry.

257
00:16:53,200 --> 00:16:55,540
Sir, sir, we're finished.

258
00:16:55,540 --> 00:16:57,300
So it's finally over.

259
00:16:57,300 --> 00:16:59,140
It looks perfect.

260
00:16:59,140 --> 00:17:02,060
It's stuck to my head like it's glued on,
nice and sharp.

261
00:17:02,060 --> 00:17:04,600
Well, that's the power of bio, of course.

262
00:17:08,300 --> 00:17:09,020
How much is it?

263
00:17:09,020 --> 00:17:12,660
Since it's your first visit,
this one's on the house.

264
00:17:12,660 --> 00:17:13,760
Thanks. Much obliged.

265
00:17:13,760 --> 00:17:14,700
No, not at all.

266
00:17:14,700 --> 00:17:15,860
I'll be back.

267
00:17:15,860 --> 00:17:17,400
We'd love to see you again.

268
00:17:19,540 --> 00:17:21,000
Let's get out of here, Tarō!

269
00:17:21,000 --> 00:17:22,040
Yes, sorry.

270
00:17:24,780 --> 00:17:26,300
That feels refreshing.

271
00:17:32,120 --> 00:17:33,160
Plastic models or...

272
00:17:33,160 --> 00:17:35,080
Ryo-san?

273
00:17:36,740 --> 00:17:38,080
I look more handsome now, right?

274
00:17:38,080 --> 00:17:43,160
Is that the latest trend or something?

275
00:17:44,260 --> 00:17:45,500
I'm back.

276
00:17:47,000 --> 00:17:49,040
How about it? This time it's perfect, right?

277
00:17:50,380 --> 00:17:51,900
This might be...

278
00:17:53,000 --> 00:17:55,720
He must have had another
barbershop trouble again, I bet.

279
00:17:55,720 --> 00:17:56,340
Yone?

280
00:17:58,880 --> 00:17:59,680
Senpai.

281
00:18:01,820 --> 00:18:03,320
Whoa, what the hell is this?

282
00:18:03,960 --> 00:18:05,900
Looks like he got messed up again.

283
00:18:06,740 --> 00:18:08,680
Looks that way. My condolences.

284
00:18:08,680 --> 00:18:11,900
Damn that old man!

285
00:18:17,840 --> 00:18:18,620
He got away.

286
00:18:18,620 --> 00:18:19,920
Damn it!

287
00:18:20,960 --> 00:18:22,600
He can't have gone far yet.

288
00:18:25,620 --> 00:18:27,320
I'm really sorry, Master.

289
00:18:27,320 --> 00:18:29,920
Honestly, hiring you was the
biggest mistake I've ever made.

290
00:18:29,920 --> 00:18:31,020
I'm sorry.

291
00:18:31,020 --> 00:18:32,460
Found you!

292
00:18:34,720 --> 00:18:36,660
You're supposed to say
"I'm sorry," remember?!

293
00:18:36,940 --> 00:18:38,220
He's the one who did it, this guy!

294
00:18:39,060 --> 00:18:41,540
Sorry, sorry, sorry!

295
00:18:41,660 --> 00:18:43,660
So you did it again this time too?!

296
00:18:45,660 --> 00:19:06,160


297
00:19:06,160 --> 00:19:08,800
Sorry, sorry,
we don't need some sorry-excuse police!

298
00:19:09,780 --> 00:19:10,140
What?

299
00:19:11,140 --> 00:19:13,240
Your hair's never going to grow back,
you know.

300
00:19:14,180 --> 00:19:17,940
Yes, we've removed it at the root with
the power of our powerful bio treatment.

301
00:19:17,940 --> 00:19:22,740
Since it's a good opportunity, you should repent
for your past behavior and become a monk or something.

302
00:19:22,740 --> 00:19:23,640
No way.

303
00:19:24,680 --> 00:19:28,140
This is all your fault.
What are you going to do about it?

304
00:19:28,140 --> 00:19:29,160
I-I'm sorry.

305
00:19:29,160 --> 00:19:33,320
Letting someone like you become a
barber was the mistake from the start.

306
00:19:33,320 --> 00:19:34,360
I'm sorry.

307
00:19:36,160 --> 00:19:39,460
You promised your parents back
home you'd become a proper customer.

308
00:19:39,460 --> 00:19:40,340
How would I know that!

309
00:19:40,560 --> 00:19:42,460
If you keep being a customer like this,

310
00:19:42,460 --> 00:19:43,760
nothing good will come of it!

311
00:19:44,000 --> 00:19:45,180
Stop it right now!

312
00:19:45,600 --> 00:19:46,920
I think so too.

313
00:19:48,360 --> 00:19:49,740
It's Senpai's hair, though.

314
00:19:49,740 --> 00:19:51,480
Maybe we can do something about it.

315
00:19:51,480 --> 00:19:52,320
What?

316
00:20:00,080 --> 00:20:03,520
Nakagawa Pharmaceutical was
developing a powerful hair-growth drug.

317
00:20:03,960 --> 00:20:05,920
With this, even if the hair roots are gone,

318
00:20:06,160 --> 00:20:07,320
hair supposedly grows back.

319
00:20:07,320 --> 00:20:08,920
That's good news, Ryo-chan.

320
00:20:08,920 --> 00:20:11,040
Phew, now I can rest easy.

321
00:20:14,120 --> 00:20:15,000
Alright!

322
00:20:15,600 --> 00:20:17,140
Good morning, senpai.

323
00:20:17,140 --> 00:20:17,940
Oh my.

324
00:20:18,800 --> 00:20:19,500
Here we go.

325
00:20:20,640 --> 00:20:21,900
It's already growing back?

326
00:20:23,120 --> 00:20:25,580
It's because I've always been a good person.

327
00:20:26,260 --> 00:20:26,980
That's strange.

328
00:20:27,540 --> 00:20:29,080
According to the lab staff,

329
00:20:29,080 --> 00:20:32,120
it should take about a
week for hair to grow back.

330
00:20:32,500 --> 00:20:34,400
Don't lump me in with ordinary people.

331
00:20:36,980 --> 00:20:38,100
Now that you mention it,

332
00:20:38,100 --> 00:20:38,780
that's right.

333
00:20:40,100 --> 00:20:42,720
But Ryo-chan,
isn't your hair longer than before?

334
00:20:43,520 --> 00:20:45,500
It's definitely growing, senpai.

335
00:20:47,380 --> 00:20:48,020
What is this?

336
00:20:48,600 --> 00:20:50,100
I can't see a thing in front of me.

337
00:20:50,500 --> 00:20:51,260
What the hell?

338
00:20:51,260 --> 00:20:52,640
A whole day has passed.

339
00:20:52,640 --> 00:20:55,340
My hair is growing faster than expected.

340
00:20:55,340 --> 00:20:57,160
Hurry up and do something about this!

341
00:20:59,820 --> 00:21:02,040
The research lab should
have a growth inhibitor too.

342
00:21:02,040 --> 00:21:03,040
If we use that,

343
00:21:04,960 --> 00:21:06,080
Hey, watch out!

344
00:21:06,100 --> 00:21:07,880
Hey, don't come near me!

345
00:21:17,920 --> 00:21:19,300
Are you all right, senpai?

346
00:21:19,520 --> 00:21:21,480
My hair cushioned the fall. Lucky.

347
00:21:21,900 --> 00:21:25,540
No choice. I'll go get the medicine.
Senpai, please don't move from here.

348
00:21:26,000 --> 00:21:26,780
Leave it to you!

349
00:21:36,780 --> 00:21:39,580
I guess I really don't
have any talent after all...

350
00:22:05,920 --> 00:22:08,220
But I... I...

351
00:22:19,240 --> 00:22:21,260
I didn't expect it to grow this much.

352
00:22:21,260 --> 00:22:24,340
We have to make an emergency descent
right in front of the field ahead!

353
00:22:24,340 --> 00:22:25,160
Roger.

354
00:22:31,340 --> 00:22:32,300
How is it?

355
00:22:33,140 --> 00:22:34,480
My hair has wrapped itself around the rotor.

356
00:22:34,480 --> 00:22:35,600
The controls are unresponsive!

357
00:22:35,600 --> 00:22:36,660
It's gotten like this...

358
00:22:46,100 --> 00:22:46,820
That was...

359
00:22:46,820 --> 00:22:48,280
Hey, Nakagawa!

360
00:22:48,280 --> 00:22:49,000
Are you all right?

361
00:22:50,180 --> 00:22:50,900
I'm fine.

362
00:22:50,900 --> 00:22:53,060
My hair cushioned the landing,
so we were saved.

363
00:22:54,640 --> 00:22:56,320
But from here,

364
00:22:56,320 --> 00:22:57,460
getting all the way over there

365
00:22:57,460 --> 00:22:58,660
is a near-impossible feat.

366
00:22:58,660 --> 00:23:00,360
Right, I've got an idea.

367
00:23:00,360 --> 00:23:05,220
Senpai! I'll load the chemical into
a pellet and snipe your head directly.

368
00:23:05,600 --> 00:23:07,460
Keep your head facing this way, please.

369
00:23:07,460 --> 00:23:08,100
Got it.

370
00:23:09,080 --> 00:23:10,400
I only have one shot.

371
00:23:10,400 --> 00:23:11,660
If I miss, it's all over.

372
00:23:12,440 --> 00:23:14,200
You know how good my aim is.

373
00:23:15,940 --> 00:23:16,860
Don't worry.

374
00:23:24,960 --> 00:23:27,780
Ever since I was a child,
I've worked hard to become a barber.

375
00:23:27,780 --> 00:23:30,020
I can't give up at this young age.

376
00:23:30,720 --> 00:23:32,120
That's right! I'm young!

377
00:23:32,240 --> 00:23:34,300
What's the point of getting
discouraged over one or two failures!

378
00:23:37,160 --> 00:23:38,300
Alright, fire!

379
00:23:39,560 --> 00:23:40,760
I'm going to keep trying harder!

380
00:23:44,480 --> 00:23:46,760
The growth inhibitor...

381
00:23:47,300 --> 00:23:49,260
It's you again, Sentarā!

382
00:23:51,140 --> 00:23:52,720
S-sorry!

383
00:23:53,580 --> 00:23:55,240
Sorry isn't going to cut it!

384
00:23:55,920 --> 00:23:57,080
Sorry!

385
00:24:05,980 --> 00:24:13,400
If we're playing baseball,
let's do it this way.

386
00:24:13,400 --> 00:24:15,340
Out! Safe!

387
00:24:15,340 --> 00:24:17,280
Yoyoi no yoi!

388
00:24:17,800 --> 00:24:21,280
Next time,
let's go with the baseball game, okay?

389
00:24:44,060 --> 00:24:45,760
that prediction

390
00:24:46,640 --> 00:24:47,560
Dun dun!

391
00:24:47,560 --> 00:24:48,360
and it's decided

392
00:24:48,870 --> 00:24:49,800
and an idea strikes

393
00:24:49,800 --> 00:24:50,380
Uyaa!

394
00:24:50,440 --> 00:24:51,420
and bounces away

395
00:24:51,420 --> 00:24:51,900
Debe-debe!

396
00:24:51,980 --> 00:24:52,760
and wraps it up

397
00:24:52,760 --> 00:24:53,320
Flustered!

398
00:24:53,460 --> 00:24:54,240
and springs into action

399
00:24:54,240 --> 00:24:55,700
and flies off

400
00:24:56,760 --> 00:25:00,420
Above all, a tremendous power

401
00:25:00,420 --> 00:25:03,020
Everyone, gather

402
00:25:04,100 --> 00:25:06,380
If you come here

403
00:25:07,240 --> 00:25:09,460
like a dream

404
00:25:09,460 --> 00:25:12,640
the final energy

405
00:25:13,820 --> 00:25:17,120
Gaze at tomorrow, believe in yesterday

406
00:25:17,120 --> 00:25:20,020
Draw the universe,
and when you stand on the ground

407
00:25:20,020 --> 00:25:23,840
The star of Kameari spun around in a circle

408
00:25:26,000 --> 00:25:27,480
This should be fine, right?

409
00:25:27,480 --> 00:25:29,000
Like hell it's fine!

410
00:25:42,360 --> 00:25:43,760
Thank you for watching.

